# Bolt Bend (ruling 2024-11-08): "If a spell or ability targets the same player or object multiple times, you can't target
# it with Bolt Bend." Bot1's Kolaghan's Command destroys target artifact and deals 2 damage to any target, both Bot2's
# Ornithopter: one object, but two targets. Bot2 holds four untapped Moxen, so mana is no reason, and the cast of Bolt Bend
# at the Command is refused. The Ornithopter (0/2) is destroyed and the Command resolves normally.

